flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>User triggers optimization"]
Main["**Main**<br/>set multiprocessing start method spawn<br/>call run_nsga2_optimization and export results"]
InputVars["**Input Variables**<br/>Decision variables caps for 6 buffers<br/>values range {1-10} discrete integers"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>minimize WIP<br/>maximize Throughput via negative throughput objective"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>attrs pop_size n_gen sampling crossover mutation<br/>method minimize problem"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>attrs n_var n_obj xl xu n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>method _evaluate receives population X and returns F"]
PoolProc["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>parallelizes evaluate_single_individual across n_cores"]
Evaluator["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>inputs x n_replications base_seed warmup measure_until<br/>runs multiple replications and averages WIP and throughput"]
Simulator["**run_simulation_moo**<br/>inputs caps seed warmup measure_until<br/>construct DelayBuffer and Machine instances<br/>run simpy environment and return metrics"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**<br/>attrs cap delay store tokens _in_transit<br/>methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>attrs name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>methods run _breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
History["**Optimization History**<br/>stores populations X F G across generations<br/>used by export_history_to_csv"]
ExportCSV["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>reads history and writes CSV file in results directory<br/>fields include capacities wip throughput"]
End["**End**<br/>CSV exported and optimization complete"]

Start --> Main
Main --> InputVars
Main --> Objectives
Main --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> PoolProc
PoolProc --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> Simulator
Simulator --> DelayBufferClass
Simulator --> MachineClass
Simulator --> Evaluator
PoolProc --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> History
History --> ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> End